      "jnv": "Interactive jq explorer; jaq covers the scripted path on both platforms.",
      "xh": "HTTP client; Ubuntu installs httpie from apt for the same role.",
      "yazi": "TUI file manager; no alias binds it, and its Ubuntu build needs a newer toolchain than the supported releases carry."
    }
  }
}
